#: inc/class-wcml-install.php:304
#, php-format
msgid "We detected that the %1$sproduct_type%2$s field was set incorrectly for some product translations. This happened because the product_type taxonomy was translated. You can fix this in the WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce %3$stroubleshooting page%4$s."
